                  {
                    "value": "MANAGEMENT ACTION TABLE  Mixed grain: target intersection, Customer, or Snapshot x Distributor x Product. Read score, action type, evidence, Primary Driver, and template at source grain.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#374151"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "SAFE Q4 MAPPING  Inventory relevance is Category-only. Do not add customer exposure or inventory rows to target-gap dollars.",
